  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "情緒價值與行銷溝通",
    "sub_ename": "EMOTIONAL VALUE AND MARKETING COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在探討情緒價值在現代行銷溝通中的關鍵角色,使學生深入理解消費者情緒反應對品牌溝通、廣告效果與購買決策的影響。課程結合理論與實務,培養學生運用情緒測量技術與行銷策略的能力,以創造具有情緒共鳴的行銷傳播內容。",
    "describe_eh": "This course explores the pivotal role of emotional value in contemporary marketing communications, enabling students to gain a deep understanding of how consumer emotional responses influence brand communication, advertising effectiveness, and purchasing decisions. Integrating theory with practice, the course cultivates students' ability to apply emotional measurement techniques and marketing strategies to create emotionally resonant marketing communications.",
