      "scr_dup": "001",
      "tpd_seq": 0,
      "tpd_week": "2",
      "tpd_reading": "<div>情緒價值導論</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>What is Emotional Value? Why Does It Matter in Marketing?</div>\n\n<div>為什麼情緒是行銷的新貨幣？</div>\n\n<div><em>「</em><em>消費者不買產品，他們買的是『更好的自己』與『感受</em><em>』。」</em></div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>經濟價值的演進</strong></div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>為什麼「情緒」在現代行銷至關重要?</strong></div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>雙系統理論</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>軀體標記假說</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>情緒價值的定義與三大維度</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>情緒價值的定義與起源</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>為何情緒價值是行銷核心？</strong></div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>情緒 vs 理性：行銷溝通的兩條路</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
      "tpd_reading_en": null,
      "tpd_learn": null,
      "tpd_learn_en": null,
      "tpd_duedate": null,
      "tpd_duedate_en": null,
